            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na woni w’onthe nũtw’ĩkĩte kwenyu ta ndeto sya ĩvuku yĩla yĩvingĩtwe yĩkasiĩlwa, yĩla andũ mamũnenga mũndũ ũla ũmanyĩĩtw’e mũno, makĩmwĩa, Soma yĩĩ, nĩngũkwĩsũva; nake asya, Nditonya, nũndũ yĩvingĩtwe yĩkasiĩlwa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ĩvuku yĩienengwa ũla ũtamanyĩĩtw’e, makĩmwĩa, Soma yĩĩ, nĩngũkwĩsũva, nake asya, Ndimanyĩĩtw’e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
